      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791122330234,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚙️ Computed on-the-fly SQL View\n🔴 HIGH: >=2 missed HW or active RED flag\n🟡 MEDIUM: 1 missed HW or AMBER flag\n🟢 OK: All up to date\n🎯 Query: v_attention_queue\n⚡ Zero storage delay / Always live",
      "fontSize": 13,
